OL,3,GNEWSARisks being taken with heating oil
OL,4,Aorders, firm says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeating oil customers who are worried
OL,7,Fabout the cost are taking risks by
OL,8,Fdelaying orders in the hope of a price
OL,9,Ffall, a firm has warned.
OL,11,FMarsh Fuels, which supplies heating oil
OL,12,Fin Berkshire and Hampshire, said its
OL,13,Fsales were lower than expected as
OL,14,Fcolder weather approaches.
OL,16,FHowever, the firm said customers could
OL,17,Frun out of oil or expose themselves to
OL,18,Feven higher bills by waiting.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
